#: ../../source/docs/aborting-autolanding.rst:5
#: f53dbfc5c4fb4231bad18f5203a315c9
msgid "How to Abort an Autolanding"
msgstr "如何中止自动降落"

#: ../../source/docs/aborting-autolanding.rst:6
#: 4a792523452b4af4accf0d367613c59b
msgid ""
"A landing-abort mechanism is provided to allow you to abort a autolanding"
" sequence in a safe, controlled, and expected way. Custom abort behaviour"
" can be pre-programmed as part of the mission or you can use the default "
"abort mechanism. To enable autolanding abort feature, set param "
":ref:`LAND_ABORT_THR<LAND_ABORT_THR>` = 1."
msgstr ""
"系统提供了一种降落中止机制，让您能够以安全、可控、可预期的方式中止自动降落序列。您可以在任务中预设自定义的中止行为，也可以使用默认的中止机制。要启用自动降落中止功能，请设置参数"
" :ref:`LAND_ABORT_THR<LAND_ABORT_THR>` = 1。"

#: ../../source/docs/aborting-autolanding.rst:8
#: ccfc838c436b4ac79258d5b0cd3ff3f2
msgid "There are three aspects of this feature:"
msgstr "该功能包含三个方面："

#: ../../source/docs/aborting-autolanding.rst:10
#: df8331a35b7342dba3ff5ff2728dec4d
msgid ":ref:`Triggering an abort <trigger_an_abort>`"
msgstr ":ref:`触发中止 <trigger_an_abort>`"

#: ../../source/docs/aborting-autolanding.rst:11
#: a582b4809e374791b7f7725a14ae1c17
msgid ":ref:`The behavior during the abort <behavior_during_the_abort>`"
msgstr ":ref:`中止过程中的行为 <behavior_during_the_abort>`"

#: ../../source/docs/aborting-autolanding.rst:12
#: 78c4a86c97cf42d18ba8ea76ef77001c
msgid ""
":ref:`The mission state after the abort completes "
"<mission_state_after_an_aborted_landing_completes>`"
msgstr ":ref:`中止完成后的任务状态 <mission_state_after_an_aborted_landing_completes>`"

#: ../../source/docs/aborting-autolanding.rst:18
#: 64952ccf02a44430a28dc6b1340f59ef
msgid "Step 1) Abort land triggers"
msgstr "步骤 1）触发降落中止"

#: ../../source/docs/aborting-autolanding.rst:19
#: e9f54c245938436e8d75044c6df71271
msgid ""
"The are three ways to trigger an auto-landing abort. All of them will "
"only work while in AUTO mode and currently executing a ``NAV_LAND`` "
"waypoint mission item:"
msgstr "有三种方式可以触发自动降落中止。所有方式仅在 AUTO 模式下、当前正在执行 ``NAV_LAND`` 航点任务项时有效："

#: ../../source/docs/aborting-autolanding.rst:21
#: 6e320db294e64164af750acc99a6b847
msgid ""
"**Send the ``MAV_CMD_DO_GO_AROUND`` command using a GCS.** Mission "
"Planner has a button labeled \"Abort Landing\" on the FlightData Actions "
"tab."
msgstr ""
"**通过地面站发送 ``MAV_CMD_DO_GO_AROUND`` 指令。** Mission Planner "
"在「飞行数据」的「动作」标签页中提供了「中止降落」按钮。"

#: ../../source/docs/aborting-autolanding.rst:22
#: 4a3d87befae440d3a600d5c92c9574f5
msgid ""
"**RC input Throttle > 90%**. This will trigger an abort while staying in "
"AUTO mode. The throttle only needs to be high briefly to trigger it. "
"Don't forget to lower it!"
msgstr "**RC 输入油门 > 90%**。这将在保持 AUTO 模式的同时触发中止。油门只需短暂拉高即可触发，之后记得放回！"

#: ../../source/docs/aborting-autolanding.rst:23
#: cbf3edf75b57418286d2f319dcae30fb
msgid ""
"**Mode change**. For human piloted landing abort you can switch out of "
"AUTO mode into, for example MANUAL/STABILIZE/FBWA, and navigate the "
"aircraft safely however you'd like. Using this method will skip abort "
"behavior step 2 because it is being done manually. When switching back to"
" AUTO the mission will resume as described in step 3 below."
msgstr ""
"**切换飞行模式**。对于人工操控的降落中止，您可以从 AUTO 模式切换至其他模式，例如 "
"Manual/Stabilize/FBWA，并以您喜欢的方式安全驾驶飞机。使用此方式将跳过中止行为步骤 2，因为视为飞手已手动接管。切换回 "
"AUTO 时，任务将按下方步骤 3 所述继续执行。"

#: ../../source/docs/aborting-autolanding.rst:28
#: 1ceea4b6479f4575a6d1a7764f4d856c
msgid "Step 2) Abort land flight behavior"
msgstr "步骤 2）降落中止的飞行行为"

#: ../../source/docs/aborting-autolanding.rst:29
#: 4412c44a888544be8437b29e3c2c51c7
msgid ""
"The abort behaviour has a default configuration and does not require a "
"pre-planned mission. The default abort behavior is to simulate an auto-"
"takeoff: pitch up at least 10 degrees and set throttle to "
":ref:`TKOFF_THR_MAX<TKOFF_THR_MAX>` and hold the heading until it reaches"
" a target altitude of 30m. It is possible to override the pitch and "
"altitude to allow for a customized behavior."
msgstr ""
"中止行为有默认配置，无需预先规划任务。默认中止行为是模拟自动起飞：俯仰角至少抬起 10 度，油门设置为 "
":ref:`TKOFF_THR_MAX<TKOFF_THR_MAX>`，并保持航向直到达到目标高度 30m。可以覆盖俯仰角和高度以实现自定义行为。"

#: ../../source/docs/aborting-autolanding.rst:31
#: 1559767691f54545a5161338a30355de
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Pitch minimum. If there was a NAV_TAKEOFF ever executed on this mission "
"then the same minimum pitch (param1) will be reused here."
msgstr "最小俯仰角。如果此次任务中曾执行过 NAV_TAKEOFF，则将重用相同的最小俯仰角（param1）。"

#: ../../source/docs/aborting-autolanding.rst:32
#: db5f1d4b912b4999a8e96cc5a1cd7fa3
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Target altitude. If NAV_LAND param1 is >0 then it is used as a target "
"altitude in meters. Else If a NAV_TAKEOFF was ever executed on this "
"mission then the same altitude (param7) will be reused here."
msgstr ""
"目标高度。如果 NAV_LAND param1 > 0，则将其用作目标高度（米）。否则，如果此次任务中曾执行过 "
"NAV_TAKEOFF，则重用相同的高度（param7）。"

#: ../../source/docs/aborting-autolanding.rst:34
#: 19e6fba5c1ab4b988307208af9f2edcf
msgid ""
"This step is skipped if the abort trigger is via mode change because it "
"is assumed the pilot manually took over and flew the aircraft to a safe "
"altitude at the pitch and throttle of their choosing."
msgstr "如果中止是通过切换模式触发的，则跳过此步骤，因为此时视为飞手已手动接管，并以其选择的俯仰角和油门将飞机飞至安全高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/aborting-autolanding.rst:39
#: d99dd6b706ec411da16622a9451655ac
msgid "Step 3) Mission state after an aborted landing completes"
msgstr "步骤 3）中止降落完成后的任务状态"

#: ../../source/docs/aborting-autolanding.rst:40
#: 1c5dad254bdc42349fdd12c58e0ddea3
msgid ""
"Once an abort land has completed, by either reaching the target altitude "
"or switching back to AUTO, the mission index will have changed and you "
"will no longer be executing a NAV_LAND command. The mission index will "
"change to be one of these three options and checked for in this order:"
msgstr ""
"一旦降落中止完成（到达目标高度或切换回 AUTO），任务索引将发生变化，将不再执行 NAV_LAND "
"指令。任务索引将按以下优先顺序变更为以下三种之一："

#: ../../source/docs/aborting-autolanding.rst:42
#: 7776a904d1f148dd83cc986763fa3698
msgid ""
"If the NAV_LAND mission item is followed by mission item "
":ref:`CONTINUE_AND_CHANGE_ALT <mav_cmd_nav_continue_and_change_alt>` with"
" param1 = 0 or 1 then the mission index will increment once to that "
"command and execute it like normal. This can be followed by further post-"
"abort mission planning for any custom planned mission behavior."
msgstr ""
"如果 NAV_LAND 任务项之后紧跟任务项 :ref:`CONTINUE_AND_CHANGE_ALT "
"<mav_cmd_nav_continue_and_change_alt>` （param1 = 0 或 "
"1），则任务索引将递增一次至该指令并正常执行。之后可以继续进行任何自定义的中止后任务规划。"

#: ../../source/docs/aborting-autolanding.rst:43
#: ecd0b73eb9a845fb9046410217aef11b
msgid ""
"Else If there is a :ref:`DO_LAND_START <mav_cmd_do_land_start>` in the "
"mission then it jumps to that index."
msgstr "否则，如果任务中存在 :ref:`DO_LAND_START <mav_cmd_do_land_start>`，则跳转至该索引。"

#: ../../source/docs/aborting-autolanding.rst:44
#: a2f59ed08f3a4511ac527d541dce4cae
msgid ""
"Else the mission index decrements once to be the index before the "
"NAV_LAND. This will ensure the same landing approach is repeated."
msgstr "否则，任务索引递减一次，变为 NAV_LAND 之前的索引，以确保重复相同的进近降落。"

